        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natalie Wood, Warren Beatty, Susan Blanchard, Jerome Robbins\n- Films: Splendor in the Grass, Alphabet City\n- Roles: Johnny's mother\n\nFacts:\n- In 1961, Natalie Wood and Warren Beatty starred in the film \"Splendor in the Grass.\"\n- Jerome Robbins directed \"Splendor in the Grass.\"\n- The New York Times described Jerome Robbins as \"one of the most honored and influential directors in Broadway and Hollywood history.\"\n- Susan Blanchard starred alongside Natalie Wood and Warren Beatty in \"Splendor in the Grass.\"\n- Susan Blanchard played Johnny's mother in the film \"Alphabet City.\"",
